-- Dungeon plans for the run leader (.bot run), exported by turtle-agent (plan-export). Plan format v1; the mapping is
-- docs/guides/dungeon-run-leader.md ("From plan v1 to rows"). The plan file in turtle-agent is the single source: edit it
-- there and export again, never these rows by hand. The plan row carries the unit lists cc_priority, cc_always and kill_first
-- (columns from 20261015200000_world.sql). Never edit this file once applied; export a new one.
--
-- Idempotent: each plan's rows are deleted, then inserted. The tables come from 20261014150000_world.sql.

--
-- turtle-agent f6737359 (fix/route-order-lower_blackrock_spire): `plan-export --allow-draft --gm-cross-direct --floor-aware
-- --approach-hops --mmaps <the server's mmaps> --rev f6737359 --stamp 20261114220000`. Lower Blackrock Spire route order
-- fix (issue #1542): the same seven bosses in the same order and the same 113 packs; 79 packs move to the leg whose walk
-- passes them, the seven leg `to` points move onto that walk (existing deployed rows) and Omokk's boss approach
-- 10 -576.2 29.7 (the far end of the pit corridor) goes. 183 steps (191 rows) instead of the deployed 393 (a fresh
-- export of the old order: 575), 4,830 yd instead of 16,204 (16,456 fresh); the straight route is 2,994 yd. The
-- turtle-agent commit message names the row behind each moved point. plan-check: 362 points, 144 lint findings (135
-- fail) against the old order's 511 (152 fail), and the plan leaves planCheckKnownFailing; plan-probe: 183 steps,
-- 0 bad; trash-check at level 57: 122 danger segments (438) and no unplanned pack the old route did not wake.

-- lower_blackrock_spire: map 229, 7 legs, 183 steps
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_step` WHERE `plan` = 'lower_blackrock_spire';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_leg` WHERE `plan` = 'lower_blackrock_spire';
DELETE FROM `ai_dungeon_plan` WHERE `plan` = 'lower_blackrock_spire';
